      "offset": 5863,
      "excerpt": "類編》二十四卷\n\n　　施浚明《古今紆籌》十二卷\n\n　　楊惟休《武略》十卷\n\n　　孫承宗《車營百八扣》一卷\n\n　　徐常《陣法舉要》一卷\n\n　　龍正《八陣圖演注》一卷\n\n　　瞿汝稷《兵略纂聞》十二卷\n\n　　茅元儀《武備志》二百四十卷\n\n　　孫元化《經",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷98",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B798",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594716",
      "textSha256": "34f3fb1cad462c259feb2f24984a1a0b4b80025361c9cc4037af8e78c703e3a6",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-792e9b3bc9b439a4",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 14474,
      "excerpt": "、詩三卷\n\n　　唐汝詢《編篷集》十卷\n\n　　曾異撰《紡授堂集》二十七卷\n\n　　《孫承宗奏議》三十卷，《文集》十八卷\n\n　　賀逢聖《文類》五卷\n\n　　蔣德璟《敬日草》九卷\n\n　　黃景昉《甌安館集》三十卷\n\n　　《倪元璐奏牘》三卷，《詩文集》十七卷\n",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷99",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B799",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2630015",
      "textSha256": "6f6ae3997d2ccdea9df9acd8890aabaea0c6aff82730a4d16a416ade7042c6cc",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-9a0ed9cdc78f6da9",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5789,
      "excerpt": "\n　一燝三月致仕。\n\n　爌\n\n　繼偕\n\n　?七月致仕。\n\n　宗彥\n\n　國祚\n\n　孫承宗二月晉兵部尚書東閣大學士入，兼掌兵部。八月晉太子太保，出鎮山海關。\n\n三年癸亥　向高正月晉中極殿大學士。七月晉左柱國。十一月晉上柱國。十二月晉少傅。\n\n　爌正月",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷110",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7110",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594726",
      "textSha256": "962c1d7cab14a894dedf472cab77760c860b19e3a1d2e8f49303b4f5c0232e08",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-37bdbb017d837956",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 11394,
      "excerpt": "慎行七月致仕。\n\n顧秉謙八月任。　鶴鳴正月加太子太保行邊。七月回部，即予告。\n\n孫承宗二月以內閣掌部事。八月出鎮。\n\n董漢儒九月任。　克纘正月改戎政。\n\n王紀二月任。七月為民。\n\n孫瑋八月召，未至。　佐正月加太子太傅。三月致仕。\n\n姚思仁四月任。",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷112",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7112",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594729",
      "textSha256": "acdd3c410200cf439c39d2b9cf35dea3c051ecf1a17dad607b457c0b6ab51f66",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-5151604f3ecb02bf",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 6537,
      "excerpt": "已，大敗，三善自殺。炯潰歸。得疾而卒。\n\n爌幼習兵略，天啟中為遼東遊擊。督師閣部孫承宗以其父死王事，獎用之，命代王楹守中右所。及巡撫袁崇煥更營制，以故官掌前鋒左營。數有功，屢遷至副總兵，守徐州。崇禎八年正月，賊陷鳳陽，大掠而去。爌及守備駱舉率兵入",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷211",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7211",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2609438",
      "textSha256": "3b01089a58c6730962af3f42f8b9127fa54c26de4834d36c7492417530f87d55",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-287c555495f747c3",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 2012,
      "excerpt": "從李如柏。天啟元年，遷大同井坪參將，調延綏。二年秋，河套入犯，不能禦，免歸。督師孫承宗召置麾下，命駐錦州。承宗去，高第盡撤松、錦守具，應昌亦歸。\n\n崇禎二年，總督楊鶴檄應昌署定邊鎮將事。河套入寇，擊斬百二十餘級，擢昌平副總兵，鶴遂薦應昌以副將鎮定",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷239",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7239",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594867",
      "textSha256": "cd48ff039be3d1239754fc8a0da908f73fdb307fcfe281f19ac9b61f5a3609e9",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-5428a20bfac9b397",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 4248,
      "excerpt": "旨留，由是忤一貫意。尋歷祭酒，詹事，掌翰林院事。四十五年春，京察，黨人用事，謀逐孫承宗、繆昌期等，一燝力保持得免。故事，掌院無滿歲不遷者，一景居四年，始遷禮部右侍郎，教習庶吉士。光宗即位，擢禮部尚書兼東閣大學士，參預機務，偕何宗彥、韓爌並命。時內",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷240",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7240",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594868",
      "textSha256": "ad07288a4ecf69a89f67e49a7bec3e305cdbb0a6f9c8402611d043fa2a6a811b",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-3a35ee995b59c746",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5761,
      "excerpt": "內外兼用，今盡用京卿，不若揚歷外服者之練習。」又數陳邊事，力詆大將馬世龍，忤樞輔孫承宗意。時帝在位數年，未嘗一召見大臣。尊素請復便殿召對故事，面決大政，否則講筵之暇，令大臣面商可否。帝不能用。\n\n四年二月，大風揚沙，晝晦，天鼓鳴，如是者十日。三月",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷245",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7245",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594873",
      "textSha256": "79f8926e118484a622a7799d26a14e01ad6e03f84602b30fdd25ec99dd2c7339",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-b3a5d055a6e087b5",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 1702,
      "excerpt": "史，總理薊、遼、保定軍務。大清兵由大安口入內地，策不能禦，被劾。祖大壽東潰，策偕孫承宗招使還。明年正月與總兵張士顯並逮，論死，棄市。\n\n縉芳，晉江人。為御史，首為顧憲成請謚，劾天津稅監馬堂九大罪，有敢言名。巡兩淮，頗通賓客賂遺，被劾，坐贓。天啟中",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷248",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7248",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2630042",
      "textSha256": "ed319e582f94be70238d59b595183e6f5543f754eb04b049a11bd501be3e3111",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-00ee9b1dacce2046",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5626,
      "excerpt": "壯士擊斬賊。無何，賊數萬猝至，安世單騎鬥，手馘數人，詣上官請兵復其城。帝用大學士孫承宗言，超擢僉事，監軍討賊，屢戰有功。五年四月，總督朱燮元上言：「自遵義五路進兵，永寧破巢之後，大小數百戰，擒獲幾四萬人，降賊將百三十四人，招撫群賊及土、漢、苗仲二",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷249",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7249",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2646328",
      "textSha256": "5adebc9bae87de8b3c78771931ef0ecd5ba735ad1adb0de0cc404edff75b5c85",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-8e7e580d882d918b",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 26,
      "excerpt": "〔篇題：卷二百五十 列傳第一百三十八〕\n〔編者說明：孫承宗子:鉁 等〕\n\n孫承宗\n\n　　孫承宗，字稚繩，高陽人。貌奇偉，須髯戟張。與人言，聲殷牆壁。始為縣學生 ，授經邊郡。往來飛狐、拒馬間，直走白登，又從紇干、清波故道",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷250",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7250",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594609",
      "textSha256": "cd11929233f8d2f91579c9e502a50ea0233ced60a48cf8c24a4770ebcd5de302",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-67d17a932573c6d3",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 970,
      "excerpt": "褫衣冠，國𣚴〔字形：左木右普〕薦復之，時人稱為長厚。元年五月得請歸里，薦韓爌、孫承宗自代。卒，贈太保，謚文敏。宗道、景辰事見《黃立極傳》中。\n\n周道登，吳江人。萬歷二十六年進士。由庶吉士歷遷少詹事。天啟時，為禮部左侍郎，頗有所爭執。以病歸。五年",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷251",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7251",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594513",
      "textSha256": "43131dac1425c006f63e1c6993cd02a1ecc313d70267b0e482f18bc631815e42",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-e11b1fec929ad66f",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 2,
      "offset": 453,
      "excerpt": "廷弼、王化貞議不協，命廷臣議經、撫去留，景榮數為言官所論。御史方震孺請罷景榮，以孫承宗代之。遂引疾歸。\n\n天啟四年十一月，特起為吏部尚書。當是時，魏忠賢盜國柄，群小更相倚附，逐尚書趙南星。即家起景榮，欲倚為助。比至，忠賢飾大宅以待，景榮不赴。錦衣",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷256",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7256",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594882",
      "textSha256": "35120d32f8eaec020a4f04ec59563c1df2e3599fdf334f2466df6814c7a9b577",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-9c05cd4d00f85185",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 7178,
      "excerpt": "月，遼東巡撫閻鳴泰罷，擢鳳翼右僉都御史代之。自王化貞棄廣寧後，關外八城盡空，樞輔孫承宗銳意修復，而版築未興。鳳翼聞命，疑承宗欲還朝，以遼事委之己，甚懼，即疏請專守關門。其座主葉向高、鄉人韓爌柄政，抑使弗上。既抵關，以八月出閱前屯、寧遠諸城，上疏極",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷257",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7257",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594883",
      "textSha256": "80aa9c846e303855484f002e70fe2a899baf14425eaa66ad1303e9eaeaa73357",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-53a1d227097318a3",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 6598,
      "excerpt": "三人贖徒三年。\n\n吳彥芳、王績燦\n\n彥芳，字延祖，歙縣人，為御史。大淩被圍，疏論孫承宗。又駁逆案呂純如辨冤之謬。登州用兵，請設監島中官。至是譴歸。\n\n績燦，宇偉奏，安福人。與給事中鄧英陳奸吏私派之弊，又進賜環、起廢、容諫三說。薦張鳳翔、李邦華、劉",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷258",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7258",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594893",
      "textSha256": "1b9d86dec85639702c54976b12b02566cd0adcff74a60133af997e97cde17bdd",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-805e29b8273d06fa",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 3,
      "offset": 12151,
      "excerpt": "煥以為非策，爭不得，奏記首輔葉向高。\n\n　　十三山難民十餘萬，久困不能出。大學士孫承宗行邊，崇煥請：「將五千人駐寧遠，以壯十三山勢，別遣驍將救之。寧遠去山二百里，便則進據錦州，否則退守寧遠，奈何委十萬人置度外？」承宗謀于總督王象乾。象乾以關上軍方",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷259",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7259",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2626298",
      "textSha256": "b1c106cf4a6f021d4f5ef95f3218cc092a26ebcd30374e5099c50303f1b12a5e",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-967c3356fa11f488",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 5569,
      "excerpt": "薊遼總督梁廷棟入主中樞，銜總理馬世龍違節制，命禾嘉監紀其軍。時永平四城失守，樞輔孫承宗在關門，聲息阻絕。薊遼總督張鳳翼未至，而順天巡撫方大任老病不能軍，惟禾嘉議通關門聲援，率軍入開平。二月，大清兵來攻，禾嘉力拒守，乃引去。已，分略古治鄉，禾嘉令副",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷261",
      "sourceUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7261",
      "revisionUrl": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2621163",
      "textSha256": "9acb2485238bd9cb0f8ef7fb58f27dea4cd4091fb8f3831948f9badc47244645",
      "contentPath": "/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json"
    },
    {
      "documentId": "document:mingshi-70b484b2740d03e5",
      "query": "孫承宗",
      "count": 1,
      "offset": 1366,
      "excerpt": "燮元遠在蜀，瑊擁虛位，非宗龍，黔幾殆。詔加太僕少卿。憂歸。\n\n崇禎三年起故官。用孫承宗薦，擢右僉都御史，巡撫順天。未幾，拜兵部右侍郎兼僉都御史，總督薊、遼、保定軍務。\n\n用小故奪官矣。居久之，十年十月流寇大入蜀，陷蜀三十餘州縣，帝拊髀而思宗龍曰：",
      "matchType": "name-occurrence",
      "title": "明史/卷262",
